-- `the month before` and `the month after` give the first day of the
-- previous or next month, across a change of year too.

IMPORT daydate

#ASSERT `the month before` (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS Date 1 12 2025
#ASSERT `the month before` (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS Date 1 12 2025
#ASSERT `the month before` (Date 31 3 2026) EQUALS Date 1 2 2026
#ASSERT `the month before` (Date 15 12 2026) EQUALS Date 1 11 2026
#ASSERT `the month after` (Date 15 12 2026) EQUALS Date 1 1 2027
#ASSERT `the month after` (Date 31 1 2026) EQUALS Date 1 2 2026

#EVAL `the month before` (Date 15 1 2026)
